window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-051-dc0a7dcd2c112f57.json"]={sha256:"dc0a7dcd2c112f5721f9877cb53c0c26f51fb4c54f058fe02756aafca1921dae",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-3e576f5c7b567070","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-04725-x","title":"Quantum computational advantage with a programmable photonic processor","titleEn":"Quantum computational advantage with a programmable photonic processor","publisher":"Xanadu and collaborators / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-051","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-051","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-052","referenceUrls":["https://www.xanadu.ai/blog/lighting-up-the-quantum-computing-horizon-with-aurora"],"title":"Xanadu Aurora：光纖延遲與模組同步","titleEn":"Xanadu Aurora: fiber delay and module synchronization","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：若低光通量時比值仍依圈數衰減，才將損耗歸到迴路；保留所有未偵測事件。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Attribute loss to loops only if low-flux ratios still decay with loop count; retain all nondetections. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"以群延遲決定時間槽偏移，分開傳播延遲與電子控制延遲。","differenceEn":"Use group delay to determine time-bin offsets, separating propagation and control latency.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。光源耦合0.8，三圈迴路每圈0.95，偵測效率0.9，每批10000次。 η總=η源 η圈³ η偵測；期望計數=Nη總。 代入 10000*0.8*0.95**3*0.9，得到 6173.1 counts。獨立無記憶損耗相乘；若有模式依賴或時間相關損耗，單一平均效率不足。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。假設L=200 m、群折射率1.5、c=3×10^8 m/s，時間槽50 ns。 槽數K=(n_g L/c)/(50 ns)。 代入 1.5*200/3e8/50e-9，得到 20 bins。均勻光纖延遲t=n_g L/c；色散、溫度與接頭延遲需另建項。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Source coupling is 0.8, three loops each transmit 0.95, detection is 0.9, and a batch has 10000 trials. Total η=ηsource ηloop³ ηdetector; expected counts=Nη. Substituting 10000*0.8*0.95**3*0.9 gives 6173.1 counts. Independent memoryless transmissions multiply; mode-dependent or correlated loss invalidates one averaged efficiency. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Assume L=200 m, group index1.5, c=3×10^8 m/s and 50 ns bins. Bin offset K=(n_g L/c)/(50 ns). Substituting 1.5*200/3e8/50e-9 gives 20 bins. Uniform-fiber delay is t=n_g L/c; dispersion, temperature and connectors need separate terms. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-061","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-05117-x"],"title":"QuTech 六自旋處理器：Zeeman 頻率與選址","titleEn":"QuTech six-spin processor: Zeeman frequency and addressability","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：若低光通量時比值仍依圈數衰減，才將損耗歸到迴路；保留所有未偵測事件。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Attribute loss to loops only if low-flux ratios still decay with loop count; retain all nondetections. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"用磁場到頻率的轉換建立選址表，辨別共同場漂移與局部位移。","differenceEn":"Build an addressing table from field-to-frequency conversion, distinguishing common field drift from local shifts.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。光源耦合0.8，三圈迴路每圈0.95，偵測效率0.9，每批10000次。 η總=η源 η圈³ η偵測；期望計數=Nη總。 代入 10000*0.8*0.95**3*0.9，得到 6173.1 counts。獨立無記憶損耗相乘；若有模式依賴或時間相關損耗，單一平均效率不足。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。均勻場B=0.5T，忽略超精細與磁場梯度，只做頻率帳本。 f=2×13.996×0.5。 代入 2*13.996*0.5，得到 13.996 GHz。電子自旋f=gμB B/h，採g=2與μB/h=13.996GHz/T；有效g可能依材料與方向改變。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Source coupling is 0.8, three loops each transmit 0.95, detection is 0.9, and a batch has 10000 trials. Total η=ηsource ηloop³ ηdetector; expected counts=Nη. Substituting 10000*0.8*0.95**3*0.9 gives 6173.1 counts. Independent memoryless transmissions multiply; mode-dependent or correlated loss invalidates one averaged efficiency. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Uniform B=0.5T, neglect hyperfine and gradients; this is a frequency ledger only. f=2×13.996×0.5. Substituting 2*13.996*0.5 gives 13.996 GHz. Electron-spin f=gμB B/h, usingg=2 andμB/h=13.996GHz/T; effectiveg can vary with material and direction. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-5d2632ff75600259","url":"https://www.xanadu.ai/blog/lighting-up-the-quantum-computing-horizon-with-aurora","title":"Lighting up the quantum computing horizon with Aurora","titleEn":"Lighting up the quantum computing horizon with Aurora","publisher":"Xanadu","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-fd900ae8f3096a90","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-05117-x","title":"Universal control of a six-qubit quantum processor in silicon","titleEn":"Universal control of a six-qubit quantum processor in silicon","publisher":"Philips et al. / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
